{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And He shall rest.</b> On the pattern of ושבה אל בית אביה (Leviticus 22:13), from the two that are visible:" "Now he explained that the spirit of YHWH is a spirit of wisdom and understanding, and so it is written about Joshua in the Torah (Deuteronomy 34:9):" "<b>And might.</b> For Hezekiah was mighty, for so it is written (2 Chronicles 32:5):"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {1 "Verse citation in the Hebrew reads Deut. 34:19, but the reference to Joshua's spirit is Deut. 34:9; likely a typographical error in the source."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:21.678703880Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}